; Checked concrete cubic-root and lambda identities for Eisenstein expressions.
; These specialize Mathlib/NumberTheory/NumberField/Cyclotomic/Three.lean:83-94.
; All displayed numerical equalities reduce through the declared operations;
; neither root orders, units nor lambda divisibility are assumed as axioms.
